sgp 2

construct
  point A on xaxis
  point B on yaxis
  segment AB
    d1: |AB| = 5
  point C on AB
    x_C: x(C) = 1
    y_C: y(C) = 1

find
  y_B: y(B)

where
  A (1.2605183529032358, 4.930380657631324e-30)
  B (1.9228484564762163e-30, 4.83850116068955)
  C (1, 1)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  x_C label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_C label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_B label (0.3, 0.3)
